Termination for Convenience

26.11. Notwithstanding the Authority’s right to terminate the Grant Funding Agreement pursuant to paragraph 26.10 above the Authority may terminate the Grant Funding Agreement at any time by giving at least [3 months] or [a timescale proportionate to the Funding Period; whichever is the shorter] written notice to the Grant Recipient.

